      <div><h2>The second book</h2><p>Traddyland ends where Lou walks out. The next book is about the thirty years after, and about the people still inside. Writing time is the cost.</p></div>
      <div><h2>The screenplay</h2><p>A boy on a bus to Kansas, a town full of secrets, a family split by a schism Rome had already named. The story was built for the screen, and a screenplay is in development.</p></div>
      <div><h2>The podcast and the letters</h2><p>Are You Serious? launches this fall. And a lot of the mail Lou gets is from people raised in the Society who have never said so out loud. Answering it takes time, and every letter is answered.</p></div>
